OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA mix of sunshine and showers
OL,6,Ftoday, with some heavy bursts
OL,7,Fpossible. Very windy at first, with
OL,8,Fgales along hills and coasts, easing
OL,9,Fslightly through the afternoon.
OL,10,FFeeling fresher than yesterday, with
OL,11,Ftemperatures a little above average
OL,12,Ffor late October.
OL,13,
OL,14,CTonight:FA few isolated showers around
OL,15,Fto start tonight, before these merge
OL,16,Finto longer spells of rain. Remaining
OL,17,Fwindy, though easing slightly, with
OL,18,Fnear gales along the coasts. Feeling
OL,19,Fcooler.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
