OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CWednesday:FCloudy with showery
OL,6,Foutbreaks to start on Wednesday,
OL,7,Fbecoming drier later with sunny spells
OL,8,Fdeveloping. Feeling pleasant in any
OL,9,Fsunshine with lighter winds.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,12,FTurning more settled, largely dry with
OL,13,Fsunny spells by day. Nights become
OL,14,Fmisty under lighter winds, with fog
OL,15,Fperhaps lingering into the following
OL,16,Fmorning. Rain arriving later on
OL,17,FSaturday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
